3:## Atypical maturation of the functional connectome hierarchy in autism
4:
5:![Image](./Lee2025_artifacts/image_000000_9f4c2295ac7a8ff517c6227f2aabc778ff58a21f4fcb971e263ac994a7dd48f4.png)
